        title: `6. HUID — HOW TO VERIFY YOUR JEWELLERY`,
        rawTitle: `HUID — HOW TO VERIFY YOUR JEWELLERY`,
        contentHtml: `<p>6.1   Every Aura Jewels gold jewellery article carries a Hallmark Unique Identification (HUID) — a 6-character alphanumeric code stamped on the article by the BIS-licensed Assaying &amp; Hallmarking Centre at the time of hallmarking.</p><p>6.2   The HUID is displayed on:</p><ul><li>the physical jewellery article (stamped or laser-engraved);</li><li>the GST tax invoice accompanying the order; and</li><li>the product page on the Website for each specific article (where applicable for made-to-order or ready-stock items with confirmed HUIDs).</li></ul><p>6.3   To verify the HUID of your Aura Jewels jewellery:</p><table><tr><td><p><strong>Step</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Action</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Details</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>1</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Locate the HUID</strong></p></td><td><p>Find the 6-character alphanumeric HUID code on your jewellery article (use a magnifying glass if needed — it is typically stamped on the inner surface, clasp, or shank) or on your GST invoice.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>2</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Visit BIS Portal</strong></p></td><td><p>Go to bis.gov.in on your browser. Navigate to the "Hallmarking" section and select "Verify HUID".</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>3</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Enter the HUID</strong></p></td><td><p>Type the 6-character HUID code in the verification field and submit.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>4</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>Review the Result</strong></p></td><td><p>The BIS portal will display the registered details for that HUID including: fineness/purity, assaying centre details, jeweller name, and date of hallmarking.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p><strong>5</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>BIS CAAB App</strong></p></td><td><p>Alternatively, download the BIS Care App from the Google Play Store or Apple App Store to scan and verify HUID codes using your smartphone camera.</p></td></tr></table><table><tr><td><p><strong>EVERY Aura Jewels GOLD JEWELLERY ARTICLE HAS A UNIQUE HUID</strong></p><p>No two Aura Jewels gold jewellery articles carry the same HUID. Each HUID is registered with BIS at the time of hallmarking and is permanently associated with the specific article's purity, weight, and jeweller details. This makes hallmarked jewellery fully traceable and provides customers with independent, government-backed assurance of gold purity.</p></td></tr></table>`
