        rawTitle: `SEVERABILITY`,
        contentHtml: `<p>If any provision of these Terms is found by a competent court or authority to be invalid, unlawful, or unenforceable under applicable law, that provision shall be severed from these Terms to the minimum extent necessary, and the remaining provisions shall continue in full force and effect.</p>`
